Subject: [PATCH v6 1/3] iio: adc: Add Allwinner D1/T113s/R329/T507 SoCs GPADC
Date: Wed, 14 Jun 2023 16:26:25 +0300
Message-Id: <20230614132644.699425-2-bigunclemax@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.39.2
